message: "If you use these materials, please cite them as below."
title: "HeXie-AI Venture Challenge: Assessment resources for entrepreneurship education"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-06
authors:
  - family-names: Tang
    given-names: Binqi
    affiliation: "Xi'an Jiaotong-Liverpool University"
license: CC-BY-NC-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/binqi20/hexie-ai-venture-challenge"
abstract: >-
  Assessment resources for entrepreneurship education in which students may use
  generative AI. Teams develop a venture with AI, face a moderated panel of
  simulated stakeholders with conflicting demands, record which feedback they
  adopt, reject or defer, and defend their decisions orally. Includes a
  capability rubric, AI-use declarations, decision memo and response-log
  templates, a stakeholder simulation kit with a Python prototype, an
  ESG-derived Venture Value Lens, feedback instruments and an adoption kit.
keywords:
  - entrepreneurship education
  - assessment
  - generative AI
  - stakeholder simulation
  - HeXie Management Theory
  - ESG
